<title>JAPAN: NKK says expects flat group oper profit in 97/98.</title>
<headline>NKK says expects flat group oper profit in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>NKK Corp said on Thursday it  expects its group operating profit to remain steady in 1997/98 from the previous business year.</p>
<p>NKK's group operating profit was 88.67 billion yen in 1996/97.</p>
<p>The company also forecast a parent operating profit of 59 billion yen in 1997/98, compared with a 59.41 billion yen profit in 1996/97.</p>
</text>
